{
  "description": "Single source of truth for the rankable per-trial/run metrics the backtest TRIAL worker emits onto each trial's metrics JSON. Both languages consume THIS file so the two never drift: the Python optimizer derives its objective-metric allow-list from it (services/optimizer-service/app/metrics_catalog.py), and the Java backtest side pins it with a consistency test (TrialMetricsCatalogConsistencyTest) that fails if MetricsCalculator / BenchmarkMetrics emit a key the catalog does not carry (or vice versa). Add a metric HERE + at its emit site in the same PR.",
